        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Three endings — name them. (-o, -as, -a.) How many regular -ar verbs does this pattern fit? (All of them.) Next chapter you will not learn anything either — you will use this to say something you actually mean."
            }
